        "text": {
            "description_html": "<B>Schlage B663P, Grade 1 Commercial Classroom Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>This ANSI Grade 1 Classroom Deadbolt is made for heavy use. The inside thumb turn only retracts the bolt while, from the outside, the bolt can be thrown or retracted by the use of a key. For doors 1-5/8 inches up to 2 inches thick. A heavy-duty deadbolt, it is UL listed for a 3-hour fire door with a metal dust box reinforcer with three 3\" screws. Available in 7 finishes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Classroom Deadbolt Lock</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key outside. Inside turn unit will retract bolt only. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n \r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Schlage B663P Classroom Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>1\" wrought metal trim ring reinforced with security insert.</li>\r\n<li>Metal dust box reinforcer with three 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage 6-pin C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n<li>NASI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage B663P Classroom Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Range: 1-5/8\" - 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\", square corner, box</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" x 2-1/4\", square corner faceplate, 1\" housing diameter, 1\" throw</li>\r\n</ul></p>",
