                "title": "Heavy Duty Classroom Lock, Schlage B663P",
                "description": "Schlage B663P Single Cylinder Classroom Deadbolt - This ANSI Grade 1 Classroom Deadbolt is made for heavy use. The inside thumb turn only retracts the bolt while, from the outside, the bolt can be thrown or retracted by the use of a key. For doors from 1-5/8 inches up to 2 inches thick. A heavy-duty deadbolt, it is UL listed for a 3-hour fire door with a metal dust box reinforcer with three 3 inch screws. Available in 7 finishes.",
